# evidence/ IS a deliverable and is committed: every transcript is redacted by
# the logger before it is written, so there is nothing in here to withhold.
# Screenshots are the one exception worth thinking about — they are pixels, so
# redaction cannot reach them. They are kept because a failure screenshot is
# the point, and the app is a local fake with no real data in it.
